{
  "title": "ALU",
  "text": "Add or subtract: Y is A + B, or A - B when sub is 1, modulo 256. C is the carry out; when subtracting it is 1 when nothing is borrowed (A is at least B). Z is 1 when Y is 0. An 8-bit adder is provided.",
